itory (Megara Hyblaia, Akrai, Kasmenai etc) to encompass all of eastern Sicily, reaching as far as Gela and Agrigento. The ground floor covers prehistory through to the end of the Classical period. Upstairs includes Hellenistic and Roman Syracuse and a display of material from the catacombs. A gallery displaying material from Hellenistic eastern Sicily is in preparation.",{"settlement":90,"region":90,"country":128,"address":129,"geo":130},"Italy","Viale Teocrito 66, 96100 - Siracusa",{"lat":131,"lon":132},37.07636989,15.2866213,{"type":134},"inventory",{"_":136,"mainLang":137,"languages":138},"Ancient Greek","grc",[136],{"type":140,"bibl":141},"edition",[142,156],{"type":143,"n":144,"author":145,"date":146,"citedRange":147,"ptr":148,"ref":150,"inscriptionDate":152,"title":153,"citation":154,"uri":155,"year":146},"bulletin","NSA","Orsi","1895","386",{"target":149},"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/3T2DS245",{"_":151,"target":151},"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001711","1889","Nuove esplorazioni nelle catacombe di S. Giovanni nel 1894","\u003Cspan>Paolo Orsi, «Nuove esplorazioni nelle catacombe di S. Giovanni nel 1894», \u003Ci>Notizie degli Scavi di Antichità\u003C/i>, 1895, 477–521\u003C/span>","https://www.zotero.org/groups/isicily/items/3T2DS245",{"author":145,"date":157,"citedRange":158,"ptr":159,"ref":161,"inscriptionDate":157,"title":163,"citation":164,"uri":165,"year":157},"2018","Tacc. 1, p.51",{"target":160},"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/RGRSRUHK",{"_":162,"target":162},"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002617","I Taccuini. I. Riproduzione anastatica e trascrizione dei Taccuini 1-4","\u003Cspan>Paolo Orsi, \u003Ci>I Taccuini. I. Riproduzione anastatica e trascrizione dei Taccuini 1-4\u003C/i>, a c. di Gioconda Lamagna e Giuseppina Monterosso, Accademia Nazionale dei Lincei. Monumenti Antichi. Serie Miscellanea 20 (Rome: Giorgio Bretschneider Editore, 2018)\u003C/span>","https://www.zotero.org/groups/isicily/items/RGRSRUHK",{"type":167,"bibl":168},"discussion",[17],{"editor":170,"principal":172,"contributors":173,"change":177},{"_":171,"ref":106},"Jonathan Prag",{"_":171,"ref":106},[174],{"_":171,"xml:id":175,"ref":176},"JP","http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537",{"_":178,"when":179,"who":106},"Jonathan Prag created file from autopsy","2026-06-08","",{"n":110,"url":111,"height":112,"width":113,"desc":114,"surfaceType":115},[183,185,188,190],{"atLeast":184,"atMost":184},75,{"atLeast":186,"atMost":187},70,73,{"atLeast":189,"atMost":189},20,{"atLeast":189,"atMost":189},[192,193],"Orsi, 1895, Nuove esplorazioni nelle catacombe di S. Giovanni nel 1894","Orsi, 2018, I Taccuini. I. Riproduzione anastatica e trascrizione dei Taccuini 1-4",[195,196],"3T2DS245","RGRSRUHK",[198,199,200,19,24,28,201,202,203,204,202,205,206,137],"isic002032","fragment of monumental greek inscription",{"_":5},"syracusae","siracusa","sicilia","sicily","museo archeologico regionale paolo orsi","ancient greek",[],{"title":209,"body":210,"divs":211,"editions":236,"images":246,"handnote":257},"ISic002032. Fragment of monumental Greek inscription","\u003Cdiv id=\"editions\">\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2016-10-11, magazzino B, cassette 37\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">.\u003C/span>ΤΙΣΤ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΟΥ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">.\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2016-10-11, magazzino B, cassette 37\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">·\u003C/span>ΤΙΣΤ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΟΥ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">·\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002032_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2016-10-11\" src=\"ISic002032_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002032.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2016-10-11\" src=\"ISic002032-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002032_rear_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2016-10-11\" src=\"ISic002032_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002032_rear.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2016-10-11\" src=\"ISic002032_rear-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text from autopsy\u003C/span>\u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"1\">1: \u003Cspan>Orsi: ΠΙΣΤ; lapis: the initial vertical does not join the upper horizontal, and the spacing is too narrow for Π, whereas the upper bar of the Τ is simply lost on the right\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"3\">3: \u003Cspan>Trace of a horizontal forming the upper part of a letter such as Γ, Τ, Π\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The large omicron and the horizontal outer bar of the sigma suggest a date after 200 BCE, and the size of the letters suggests some sort of monumental text, but without a more detailed provenance than simply 'Epipolai', little more can be said, except that this is a rare surviving instance of public epigraphy from later Hellenistic Syracusae.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Orsi 1889 386 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001711\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001711\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Orsi 2018 Tacc. 1, p.51 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002617\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002617\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">\u003Cp>Tall wide, plainly v-cut letters with very slight wedge serifs at the terminals.\u003C/p> Line 1  75  Line 2  70-73  Interlineation line 1 to 2  20  Interlineation line 2 to 3  20  \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>",[212,215,218,221,224,227,230,233],{"id":213,"html":214},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2016-10-11, magazzino B, cassette 37\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">.\u003C/span>ΤΙΣΤ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΟΥ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">.\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2016-10-11, magazzino B, cassette 37\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" cla